# Module 'maths'

the thing called maths_square which needs n
    give back n multiply n
thats it

the thing called maths_cube which needs n
    give back n multiply n multiply n
thats it

the thing called maths_power which needs base and exponent
    result is 1
    counter is 0
    as long as counter lessthan exponent
        result is result multiply base
        counter is counter plus 1
    done with that
    give back result
thats it

the thing called maths_root which needs num and exponent
    guess is 1
    as long as maths_power(guess, exponent) lessthaneq num
        maybe maths_power(guess, exponent) equals num
            give back guess
        done with that
        guess is guess plus 1
    done with that
    give back -1
thats it

the thing called maths_abs which needs n
    maybe n lessthan 0
        give back 0 minus n
    done with that
    give back n
thats it

the thing called maths_fact which needs n
    result is 1
    counter is 1
    as long as counter lessthaneq n
        result is result multiply counter
        counter is counter plus 1
    done with that
    give back result
thats it

the thing called maths_test
	num1 is ask number "Enter Number for Test 1: "
	yell maths_square(num1)
	num2 is ask number "Enter Number for Test 2: "
	yell maths_cube(num2)
	base is ask number "Enter Base for Test 3: "
	exponent1 is ask number "Enter Exponent for Test 3: "
	yell maths_power(base, exponent1)
	num3 is ask number "Enter Number for Test 4: "
	exponent2 is ask number "Enter Exponent for Test 4: "
	yell maths_root(num3, exponent2)
	num4 is ask number "Enter Number for Test 5: "
	yell maths_abs(num4)
	num5 is ask number "Enter Number for Test 6: "
	yell maths_fact(num5)
thats it
